# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. NEVER commit your real .env.
# `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` is committed so teammates know what's needed.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Placeholders only. Never paste real tokens into an AI chat or prompt.

